---
import meta from '../../data/meta.json';
const { currently } = meta;
---

<section class="aabout wrap" id="about">
  <div class="aabout-grid">
    <div class="aabout-left">
      <h2 class="h-big rv">I find it hard to stop building things.</h2>
      <img
        src="/illust-curious-hero.png"
        alt="Illustration of a small character building at a desk under lamplight"
        class="aabout-illust rv"
        loading="lazy"
        width="597"
        height="335"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="aabout-right">
      <p class="aabout-para rv">
        By day I keep a Tier-1 bank's identity infrastructure alive for
        30,000+ people, leading a team of five at TCS inside State Bank of
        India. Success there is invisible: when nobody notices, everything
        went right.
      </p>
      <p class="aabout-para rv">
        The rest of the time I ship products nobody assigned me. An offline
        supplication app serving a worldwide community. A running app that
        invents routes. A pocket e-ink reader built from the firmware up. An
        AI pipeline that writes first drafts so humans can do the judging.
        Every one of them exists because the alternatives were bad and I
        thought I could do better.
      </p>
      <p class="aabout-para rv">
        The part I enjoy most is always the same: deciding what to build and
        why. That is the job I want to do full-time.
      </p>
      <div class="aabout-now rv">
        <span class="mono-label">Currently</span>
        <p class="aabout-now-text">{currently}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.aabout { padding-block: var(--section-gap); }
.aabout-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 5fr 6fr;
  gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 110px);
  align-items: start;
}
.aabout-left {
  position: sticky;
  top: 110px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 40px;
}
.aabout-illust {
  border-radius: var(--r-image);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 460px;
  background: var(--surface);
}
.aabout-para {
  margin: 0 0 28px;
  max-width: 62ch;
  font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 20px);
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--muted);
}
.aabout-para:first-child { color: var(--text); }
.aabout-now {
  margin-top: 48px;
  padding: 28px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--r-surface);
  background: var(--surface);
}
.aabout-now-text {
  margin: 12px 0 0;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--muted);
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .aabout-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .aabout-left { position: static; }
  .aabout-illust { max-width: 380px; }
}
</style>
